# Paths whose ʻokina glyphs come from upstream and must not be "corrected".
#
# Council websites publish bill titles with whatever apostrophe they use.
# Rewriting them here would make our copy disagree with the source, and the
# parser tests assert on the original text.

site/bills.json
site/actions/*
site/feeds/*
data/*

# Test files assert on scraped source text verbatim; the glyphs are the fixture.
tests/*
